  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 78,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Allelopathy:** a plant releases chemicals that **suppress the growth of other plants** nearby; Lantana camara spreads partly by allelopathy."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 78,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Palamu Tiger Reserve** is in **Jharkhand**; it was one of the first nine tiger reserves under Project Tiger (1973)."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 78,
   "sec": 10,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Mount Dukono** (Indonesia), **Mayon** (Philippines), **Semeru** (Java) and **Sakurajima** (Japan) all lie on the **Pacific Ring of Fire**."
  }
 ],
